   <text:p text:style-name="P52" loext:marker-style-name="T24"><text:span text:style-name="T24">When you do this, you will probably get a message “Allow USB Debugging?”. Tap </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T27">OK</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T24">.</text:span></text:p>
